(7485959, 1191020, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow, is what I thought when I first saw this. It''s good eye Mark!!   Perfectly framed with the girl using rule of thirds. I was wondering if you would go back to this location again, if this is the same location as you used in ''from above'' :-) <br/> <br/>Ribbon for sure.<br/> <br/>Bumping to a 10, and I don''t normally hand out many these days! <br/> <br/>Btw this reminds me of Escher, and I love his work.</td>', 'Wow, is what I thought when I first saw this. It''s good eye Mark!!   Perfectly framed with the girl using rule of thirds. I was wondering if you would go back to this location again, if this is the same location as you used in ''from above'' :-)  Ribbon for sure. Bumping to a 10, and I don''t normally hand out many these days!  Btw this reminds me of Escher, and I love his work.', '2016-12-05 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
