(7486501, 1191519, 94815, '<td valign="top">I like this complex of compartmentalized scenes containing disparate stories held together by the enclosing environment. A capsule of human existence. Nice rhythm within - deriving energy from the sequence of frames and lines of the room. The slightly sinister character on the (topical) stairs adds some tension and the picture on the left makes unreasonable demands for our attention.</td>', 'I like this complex of compartmentalized scenes containing disparate stories held together by the enclosing environment. A capsule of human existence. Nice rhythm within - deriving energy from the sequence of frames and lines of the room. The slightly sinister character on the (topical) stairs adds some tension and the picture on the left makes unreasonable demands for our attention.', '2016-12-08 22:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486513, 1191514, 56502, '<td valign="top">Very impressive!</td>', 'Very impressive!', '2016-12-08 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
